">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Burooj\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/85.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Verse 10\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-10.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Verse 10</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Burooj 85:10</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ الَّذِينَ فَتَنُوا الْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَتُوبُوا فَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ الْحَرِيقِ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">Indeed, those who have tortured the believing men and believing women and then have not repented will have the punishment of Hell, and they will have the punishment of the Burning Fire.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن لحوق الوعيد مشروط بعدم التوبة، إذ نصوص التوبة مبينة لتلك النصوص<cite>«الفتاوى الكبرى لابن تيمية» 1/112</cite></blockquote><h3>What he quoted from others</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الحسن البصري</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «انظروا إلى هذا الكرم عذبوا أولياءه وفتنوهم ثم وهو يدعوهم إلى التوبة»<cite>«الفتاوى الكبرى لابن تيمية» 1/112</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فسرت الفتنة هاهنا بتعذيبهم المؤمنين، وإحراقهم إياهم بالنار، واللفظ أعم من ذلك<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 3/151</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ويدعوهم إلى التوبة وقد حاربوه وعذبوا أولياءه وأحرقوهم بالنار.<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/317</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s85a10\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/85-2.html\">Previous verse (85:2)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/85-14.html\">Next verse (85:14)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-14.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Al-Burooj 85:14 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"And He is the Forgiving, the Affectionate,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikha