p\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Verse 20</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Burooj 85:20</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَاللَّهُ مِن وَرَائِهِم مُّحِيطٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">While Allāh encompasses them from behind.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهو محيط به حيث لا يحيط الشيء بنفسه وكل شيء فى قبضته وليس شيء فى قبضة نفسه،<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/22</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s85a20\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/85-16.html\">Previous verse (85:16)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/85-22.html\">Next verse (85:22)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-22.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Al-Burooj 85:22 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"[Inscribed] in a Preserved Slate.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https: